Monterey compiler result
------------------------

A macOS 12.5.1 virtual machine exposes ANECompiler 5.5.0.
Its direct MIL route uses NetworkMILName and NetworkMILPath.
The compiler rejected the saved iOS 18 MIL syntax.

The legacy NetworkPlistName route accepts Espresso XML sources.
The retained control compiled to this artifact:

  bytes: 32,768
  SHA-256: 48732a024ba361830d961ef069672afcbf7f0b90ce6265e588af51c7344acb58

Linux M1 returned [28.0, 28.0] for input [3.0, 3.0, 3.0].
This exactly matches six fp32 weights of 3.0 plus two fp16 biases of 1.0.
The original Big Sur control still returned [27.0, 27.0, 27.0].

