Complete projection set
-----------------------

The deterministic generator is tools/qwen-espresso-graphs.py.
It covers all projection matrices used by decoder layers 0 through 23.
It excludes the unused speculative layer 24.
It splits the tied vocabulary head into 31 chunks of at most 8,192 rows.

Generation command:

  python3 tools/qwen-espresso-graphs.py \
    --model Qwen3.8-2B-Q4_K_M.gguf \
    --gguf-py ../llama.cpp/gguf-py \
    --output qwen-full-espresso

